  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-10024 MSP Global and regional support to the BBNJ Agreement ratification process and implementation readiness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project expects to create a more rapid process of entering into force of the BBNJ Agreement and strengthen the implementation readiness process. The project also aims to contribute to creating a basis for international cooperation and collaboration as required for a future integrated multi-sectoral management of human activities in ABNJ (Areas Beyond National Jurisdiction) conscious of the need to preserve marine biodiversity with the ultimate long term impact being the safeguarding of marine biodiversity in the ABNJ.</narrative>
  </description>
